# Circuit artifacts served to the browser and consumed by deploy scripts.
#
# These are generated by the trusted setup, and a key generated for a DIFFERENT
# public-signal count is silently unusable: `validate_vk` refuses to register it
# and `verify_groth16` returns false for every proof. That is strictly worse
# than a missing key, which at least fails visibly. See
# frontend/public/circuits/README.md.
frontend/public/circuits/*.zkey
frontend/public/circuits/verification_key*.json
frontend/public/circuits/comment/*.zkey
frontend/public/circuits/comment/verification_key*.json
frontend/src/lib/verification_key_soroban.json

